   "phrasing": "greet_ans_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "This is my first real interview ever, for a summer internship. What should I bring?",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.22,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Bring a couple of printed copies of your resume, a notebook and a pen. And a few questions you want to ask.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.37,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Do I need a portfolio or anything?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Only if the role is creative or technical. A class project you're proud of can be a good thing to show.",
   "est_sec": 6.61,
   "gap_before": 0.9,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I built a small app for a class",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.65,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "but it's kind of basic.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.08,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's still worth mentioning. Explain what problem it solved and what you learned building it.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.43,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg4"
  },
  {
